---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Rinha4 transport experiment</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Can ASM replace the C YOLO load balancer?</h1>
    <p class="tagline">
      A shared load-balancer workbench for the .NET, C, and assembly Rinha4 stacks. The site tracks contracts, topology, and official-like comparison evidence before any default promotion.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Primary actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={`${base}/docs/`}>Read contracts</a>
      <a class="button" href={`${base}/reports/`}>Open comparison lane</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="proof-rail" aria-label="Current load balancer state">
    <div class="rail-header">
      <span>transport/lb</span>
      <strong>decision bench</strong>
    </div>
    <dl class="rail-list">
      <div>
        <dt>Baseline</dt>
        <dd><code>C</code> image, proxy and fdpass</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Challenger</dt>
        <dd><code>ASM</code> candidate, same external contracts</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Gate</dt>
        <dd>no failures, no HTTP errors, stable p99</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </aside>
</section>
